   "minutes": "<h3>Kick-off Review — All Projects · 18 August 2026</h3><p>The <b>Mission Director</b> reviewed the progress of all three UCF projects and directed that every commitment made in this meeting be entered in the tracker with a named officer and a deadline.</p><ol><li><b>Project 1:</b> Pipeline laying in Zone A is behind schedule. Agency 1 to <mark>deploy an extra work crew by 25 August</mark>.</li><li><b>Project 2:</b> Road-cutting permissions pending with Corporation 2. To be escalated if not cleared within a week.</li><li><b>Project 3:</b> Hardware procurement tender to be published by the first week of September.</li></ol>",
