   "minutes": "<h3>Progress Review — Project 2 · 26 August 2026</h3><p><b>Item 1 — Road-cutting permissions.</b> The file has been pending with Corporation 2 for three weeks. The Chair directed escalation to the Commissioner’s office with a copy to the Mission Director, and set a hard deadline of 5 September.</p><p><b>Item 2 — Quality checks on delivered pipes.</b> The third-party laboratory report is expected by 8 September. Consignment 2 is not to be accepted until the report on consignment 1 is cleared.</p>",
