   "minutes": "<h3>Monthly Review — Project 1 · UCF/P1/RM-04 · 27 August 2026</h3><p><b>Chair:</b> Officer C (PDMC). Attendance recorded separately.</p><h3>Item 0 — Review of previous action items</h3><p>Of the three items carried forward from UCF/HO/RM-01, ACT-02 has been reported complete and is <mark>awaiting Mission Director confirmation</mark>. ACT-01 has also been reported complete and sits with the PDMC. ACT-03 continues on schedule.</p><h3>Item 1 — Zone A pipeline, revised completion target</h3><p>Agency 1 confirmed the additional crew was deployed on 24 August. Progress since is <b>410 m against a target of 380 m</b>. The chair accepted a revised completion target of <u>31 October 2026</u>, subject to the monsoon contingency below.</p><h3>Item 2 — Land acquisition, second pumping station</h3><p>Corporation 1 issued the clearance letter dated 29 August. The mutation record is still to be obtained.</p><h3>Item 3 — Monsoon contingency</h3><p>The chair directed that <mark>no trench is to be left open beyond 72 hours</mark>, with weekly inspection and photographs uploaded to the portal.</p>",
